      "writtenOn": "2019-05-16T02:33:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I usually recommend to provide a default implementation weakly:\n\n  __attribute__((weak)) int board_sensor_at_360(void)\n  {\n    return !gpio_get_level(HALL_SENSOR_GPIO_L);\n  }\n\nAnd your board can implement board_sensor_at_360 normally.",
